  <string name="hidden_api_body">This app needs to relax a head-unit hidden-API restriction (scoped to BYD com.ts.* and dalvik.system) so it can bind the local climate SDK. Tap Allow — the setting is applied and the app restarts. This resets on car reboot and is re-applied when the listener starts.</string>
